Comment: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,stuff
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.67,0:00:18.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.10,0:02:04.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Kobato, who did you give chocolate to?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.86,0:02:07.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.07,0:02:10.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I gave some to, uhh...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.70,0:02:15.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka, and Ioryogi, and Toshihiko...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.57,0:02:20.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't mean it like that! The one you were saving for the person you really like, who'd you give that to?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.63,0:02:25.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I really like everyone here, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.30,0:02:29.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,C'mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.54,0:02:30.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.39,0:02:36.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry to butt in while you're having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.89,0:02:44.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You don't need to be that worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.73,0:02:46.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Go get Sayaka for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.69,0:02:50.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you here for?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.36,0:02:53.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I came to have a chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.95,0:02:57.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,For the last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.61,0:02:59.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.33,0:03:02.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's nice. Now be a dear and move.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.46,0:03:03.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I will not!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.67,0:03:10.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.80,0:03:13.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.72,0:03:18.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay. Let him by.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.14,0:03:23.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's been a while, Sayaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.65,0:03:34.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please. Just give us a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.36,0:03:38.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How long is a little?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.41,0:03:41.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I think I've waited long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.62,0:03:47.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why have you changed so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.54,0:03:53.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I haven't changed. This is the real me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.30,0:03:57.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Liar...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.64,0:04:01.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.47,0:04:04.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you just being stubborn because of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.98,0:04:08.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You've got it all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.31,0:04:13.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're not my problem anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.20,0:04:25.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Which means I'm just here to finish things.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.46,0:04:33.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Or would you rather I have the place demolished with the children watching?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.80,0:04:41.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't get why you're so fixated on this place. You can always open a nursery somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.22,0:04:43.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.38,0:04:45.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you talking about!?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.48,0:04:47.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You should know!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.18,0:04:48.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.56,0:04:51.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This isn't just a building!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.07,0:04:55.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's Sayaka's inheritance! It's important to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.15,0:04:57.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She can't just go somewhere else!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.91,0:05:01.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you're going to go on like that, what are you really worried about protecting?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.62,0:05:05.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you care more about the building than the children?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.75,0:05:15.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't care what happens to the kids, you may as well stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.47,0:05:22.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But that would really be a case of mistaken priorities.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.88,0:05:24.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You{\fscx162}-{\fscx81}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.31,0:05:27.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.65,0:05:35.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you stick your nose in where it doesn't belong, things will just speed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.32,0:05:43.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.83,0:05:48.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll shut down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.37,0:05:51.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.54,0:05:56.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But give me until graduation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.43,0:06:08.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's Dobato up to, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.64,0:06:11.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.19,0:06:14.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.07,0:06:21.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We just dried the sheets, and now you're getting them wet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.41,0:06:24.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.12,0:06:27.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hmph.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.74,0:06:29.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're just making more work for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.50,0:06:32.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.34,0:06:43.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to go see Okiura.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.80,0:06:45.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What will you do when you get there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.47,0:06:50.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll ask him one more time not to shut down Yomogi Nursery.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.02,0:06:54.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're just going to make more of a mess out of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.72,0:06:55.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But if we just{\fscx162}-{\fscx81}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.93,0:06:57.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't go, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.29,0:07:13.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.50,0:07:16.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're{\fscx162}-{\fscx81}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.21,0:07:21.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's he up to all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.63,0:07:24.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What good would knowing do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.47,0:07:26.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is extortion.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.97,0:07:29.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If we wanted to, we'd have you in court.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.14,0:07:32.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I'd like to see that happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.19,0:07:38.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Plus, Teach there is going along with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.44,0:07:41.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You should just shut up and move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.90,0:07:45.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I won't give up. I'm going to protect that nursery.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.24,0:07:46.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh yeah? How?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.20,0:07:52.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You don't know anything about what's going on, you idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.50,0:07:58.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait! I'm not done talking to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.42,0:08:02.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing, trying to look cool saving everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.71,0:08:06.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're wasting your time whining at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.97,0:08:11.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Listen. The one who's really after that nursery is the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.89,0:08:12.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.35,0:08:15.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okiura's old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.69,0:08:24.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's the one who got the old headmaster in debt, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.15,0:08:25.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You mean{\fscx162}-{\fscx81}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.74,0:08:30.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's his fault the headmaster was stuck running around raising money like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.87,0:08:33.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He worked himself to death believing in that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.37,0:08:38.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If he knew that and went along with his father anyway, he's just as bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.33,0:08:41.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Didn't I tell you you didn't know anything!?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.00,0:08:44.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you know what would happen if the boss got involved?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.26,0:08:51.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's why Okiura is dealing with it himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.47,0:08:52.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.65,0:09:14.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I think Okiura is playing the villain to protect that nursery from the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.58,0:09:21.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If I had to guess, probably to protect the woman he loves.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.13,0:09:26.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't give me that crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.13,0:09:28.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Believe whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.68,0:09:36.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I owe that Kobato girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.85,0:09:41.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want her to get hurt if this turns sour.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.65,0:09:47.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So you'd better do what Okiura says.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.04,0:10:06.34,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,...of the mountain, we can see everything
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.34,0:10:16.47,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's look, look for new mysteries!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.73,0:10:25.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All the other nurseries are full.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.98,0:10:28.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm on the waiting lists, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.82,0:10:31.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry this happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.01,0:10:56.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, dinner's served!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.72,0:10:59.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is{\fscx162}-{\fscx81}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.13,0:11:02.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How about having dinner with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.39,0:11:05.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's less lonely if we all eat together!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.11,0:11:07.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Chise...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.11,0:11:14.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.24,0:11:17.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't eat food.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.16,0:11:27.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know how you feel. I don't think any of us are really in the mood for a meal right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.12,0:11:29.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.34,0:11:36.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm really happy you want to share!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.39,0:11:45.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daddy... I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.10,0:11:49.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wasn't able to protect the nursery.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.69,0:11:59.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even after all this, I still want to believe in him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.62,0:12:02.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so silly, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.04,0:12:08.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Chitose...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.09,0:12:13.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I saw Okiura in front of the nursery today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.59,0:12:17.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He seemed so lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.89,0:12:19.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.47,0:12:23.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's the one who wanted us gone, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.27,0:12:29.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe he still loves Sayaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.69,0:12:33.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe she still loves him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.19,0:12:40.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then why would he make her so sad?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.28,0:12:46.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sometimes, because people love each other... Because they care about each other...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.30,0:12:50.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That means they misunderstand each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.66,0:13:28.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.42,0:13:32.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If I follow him, I can meet Okiura!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.66,0:13:33.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.59,0:13:40.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.57,0:13:48.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let me talk with Mr. Okiura!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.39,0:13:50.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You should stay away from me, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.27,0:13:52.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.11,0:13:59.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's not going to see you. Go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.45,0:14:02.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.25,0:14:18.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That girl from the nursery followed me her. It probably won't be easy to get her to go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.09,0:14:21.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then just ignore her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.70,0:14:43.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's still there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.45,0:14:45.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okiura?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.12,0:14:56.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is everyone from the nursery that much of a pain in the ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.34,0:15:04.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Aren't you cold, Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.00,0:15:06.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.51,0:15:10.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you can tell, whe don't you go borrow an umbrella or wait inside for a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.80,0:15:12.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,C'mon, use your head!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.39,0:15:20.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But what if Okiura looks out the window and sees that I'm not here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.15,0:15:23.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you keep this up, he's never coming out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.41,0:15:27.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He'll come out eventually. If not today, tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.95,0:15:30.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If not tomorrow, the day after.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.25,0:15:33.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How long are you going to wait?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.58,0:15:38.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,As long as it takes for him to show his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.11,0:16:07.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you going to keep doing that forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.12,0:16:11.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okiura! I{\fscx162}-{\fscx81}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.62,0:16:14.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't have anything to say to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.41,0:16:18.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're tearing down that nursery, and the lot's worth enough to cover the loan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.79,0:16:20.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That should settle everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.55,0:16:30.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's not what I wanted to ask you about.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.14,0:16:37.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I want to know how you really feel!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.56,0:16:39.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I told you, the nursery{\fscx162}-{\fscx81}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.01,0:16:40.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's not what I mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.90,0:16:43.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're such a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.65,0:16:47.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Chitose told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.70,0:16:54.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,About you and Sayaka, and about Sayaka and you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.58,0:16:57.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That you both still love each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.59,0:17:03.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't expect you to talk about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.75,0:17:05.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okiura!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.47,0:17:11.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If Sayaka's that important to you, why are you so mean to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.52,0:17:19.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We all loved it...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.11,0:17:26.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka, me, Fujimoto...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.20,0:17:29.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone at Yomogi...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.53,0:17:33.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We all loved it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.04,0:17:36.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.50,0:17:42.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's why Sayaka tried to hard to protect it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.42,0:17:49.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But you still took it away from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.43,0:17:53.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You made Miss Sayaka sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.68,0:17:59.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't believe you're a good person anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.19,0:18:05.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But even if you're not a good person, you're important to Miss Sayaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.11,0:18:07.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can't just leave things like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.41,0:18:15.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please, tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.84,0:18:33.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We just came from different worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.43,0:18:38.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I couldn't hold back my father any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.06,0:18:43.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So this is the only way I can protect her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.61,0:18:50.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You couldn't just abandon Miss Sayaka, could you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.78,0:18:57.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You ended things because she was so important to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.21,0:19:03.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.40,0:19:26.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.77,0:19:29.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.82,0:19:31.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, I couldn't sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.07,0:19:33.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.36,0:19:35.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.78,0:19:41.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He dragged himself through the mud to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.17,0:19:45.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto, what are you{\fscx162}-{\fscx81}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.66,0:19:46.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okiura.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.05,0:19:56.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He{\fscx162}-{\fscx81}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.47,0:20:01.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But... I still can't forgive{\fscx162}-{\fscx81}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.39,0:20:02.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you saying!?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.39,0:20:06.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't forgive him, he's just going to go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.90,0:20:08.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay with that!?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.07,0:20:11.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.78,0:20:15.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I want you to be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.03,0:20:19.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's the only one that can help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.95,0:20:24.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So you have to be with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.08,0:20:27.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.31,0:20:45.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm glad you're awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.48,0:20:49.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.56,0:20:52.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He said you sere out in the rain for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.74,0:21:03.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone always ends up protecting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.12,0:21:06.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, Fujimoto...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.92,0:21:09.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And him...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.05,0:21:13.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Where's Okiura!?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.80,0:21:15.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He went home.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.59,0:21:17.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you just going to leave it like that!?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.06,0:21:23.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.31,0:21:31.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you really care about Okiura, you need to go after him!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.44,0:21:33.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.39,0:22:45.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's gonna be close.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.14,0:22:49.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't forget about your wish.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:35.97,0:00:38.85,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,{95 after the first frame of ribbon}What shall I do?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:38.85,0:00:47.15,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even the obvious things are always so hard
Dialogue: 1,0:00:47.15,0:00:56.95,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,I just want to grin when I'm happy, sing when I'm in love
Dialogue: 1,0:00:58.45,0:01:02.75,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,They say my dreams will come true someday
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.75,0:01:10.50,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,but when will someday come? I can't wait!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:10.50,0:01:16.18,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Count one, two, three and spread my arms
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.18,0:01:21.39,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Gather the light to myself
Dialogue: 1,0:01:21.39,0:01:27.69,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Where is it? Tell me what I can do
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.69,0:01:33.36,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I'm hurt so much, even if I run so hard
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.36,0:01:40.07,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I collapse crying over and over, I still
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.07,0:01:48.79,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,believe in my amazing future
Dialogue: 1,0:01:58.51,0:02:04.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,1125)\pos(360,166)\c&HFFFFFF&}... Spring's Pitter-patter.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:24.98,0:24:30.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an1\fs22\shad0\fad(500,0)\c&H000000&\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(105,384)}Next episode: "Day of Farewells"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.93,0:23:04.95,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,In between the things I've lost
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.84,0:23:11.37,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,and the things I've been able to hold on to,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.71,0:23:19.80,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Your smile falls in that gap
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.36,0:23:25.90,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,It seems like I can reach it, but I can't
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.05,0:23:31.29,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't fly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.94,0:23:37.81,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,I just wanted to make you smile
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.81,0:23:43.28,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,My two wings weren't good enough
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.57,0:23:48.75,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Why do I even have them?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.01,0:23:55.26,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Just smiling by your side
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.77,0:24:00.09,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,is all I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.62,0:24:06.94,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Just warming you is good enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.21,0:24:11.69,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,even though I want to embrace you
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.15,0:24:18.92,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even with these scarred, worthless wings,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.92,0:24:27.53,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,right now I can smile
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.60,0:23:02.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
